      "params_digest": "2e1af18ec3fba19c",
      "query": "{\"content\": \"# Reasoning: *Mead Johnson & Company, LLC, et al. v. Clarissa Greear, et al.* (No. 26-29)\\n\\n**Event:** `evt-order-call-for-response-disposition` (cert disposition after call for a response)  \\n**Input Snapshot:** `2026-09-02`  \\n**Predicted Disposition:** `denied` (`granted: false`, `probability: 0.16`)\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1. Procedural Posture & Base-Rate Anchor\\n\\nPetitioners Mead Johnson & Company, LLC and Mead Johnson Nutrition Company seek review of a published decision of the Appell",
