      "params_digest": "0eff3af22a021e0d",
      "query": "{\"content\": \"# Predicted Reasoning of the Court: *Mead Johnson & Company, LLC, et al. v. Clarissa Greear, et al.* (No. 26-29)\\n\\n## I. Predicted Disposition and Procedural Route\\n\\nThe Court will **deny the petition for a writ of certiorari** (`denied`) without a Call for the Views of the Solicitor General (`cvsg: false`) and most likely without any separate writing dissenting from or respecting the denial of certiorari, entering a standard summary denial order on a regular Monday order list aft",
